cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this concept scheme, please cite it as below."
title: "Characters of the Mahabharata: a SKOS concept scheme"
type: dataset
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-08
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
url: "https://mahabharata.tanay.uk/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/ImTanay/mahabharata"
abstract: >-
  A SKOS concept scheme of the characters of the Mahabharata. Each character is
  a skos:Concept placed under its lineage, royal house, order or class of being,
  with kinship and narrative relations as sub-properties of skos:related, labels
  in English, Devanagari and IAST, and mappings to Wikidata and DBpedia. Content
  follows the English Wikipedia article Mahabharata and the character articles
  it links to. Validated with SHACL.
authors:
  - family-names: Aggarwal
    given-names: Tanay
keywords:
  - SKOS
  - knowledge organization system
  - ontology
  - Mahabharata
  - Hindu epics
  - linked data
  - SHACL
  - Wikidata
references:
